2Ch 11:1 , Rehoboam raising an army to subdue Israel, is forbidden by Shemaiah;
2Ch 11:5 , He strengthens his kingdom with forts and provisions;
2Ch 11:13 , The priests and Levites, and such as feared God, forsaken by Jeroboam, strengthen the kingdom of Judah;
2Ch 11:18 , The wives and children of Rehoboam.
